WEBVTT

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:40.880
2065 A.D.

00:00:45.890 --> 00:00:50.360
Allied Forces, Strategic Command Base.
Eurasian Continent, Former Russian Area.

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:07.800
You're from the Fenrir Far East Branch, right?

00:01:08.370 --> 00:01:09.800
We've been waiting for you!

00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:15.900
What is this about, Director Schicksal?

00:01:16.370 --> 00:01:18.340
The only support we get from you,

00:01:18.340 --> 00:01:21.610
before such a vital operation, is only three people?

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:24.450
Do you wish me to report this to the HQ?

00:01:24.580 --> 00:01:27.270
Please calm down, Captain.

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:33.000
Each of them is capable of doing the work of an entire battalion.

00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:37.000
Besides, this operation is under your leadership.

00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:40.760
Our division specializes in post-processing.

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:43.620
Even so...

00:01:43.620 --> 00:01:49.030
And while it embarrasses me, this is my son's first mission.

00:01:49.030 --> 00:01:50.780
I'll be counting on you.

00:01:58.840 --> 00:02:01.280
The final struggle of the old human race.

00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:04.380
Let's see him witness its end.

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:13.180
Those are the divine weapon wielders,
the only ones capable of resisting the Aragami?

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:14.650
They are just children!

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:20.330
How truly vexing, to be pushed around by such people...

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:24.920
I won't allowed the others to accept it,
not as long as this operation succeeds.

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:33.510
This is a crucial, large-scale, search and destroy.
The goal is to guide the Aragami from Euroasia into a strategic location,

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:43.070
a nuclear reactor, which we'll detonate to wipe them all out at once.

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:46.620
I'd like to ask the divine weapon wielders,

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:53.680
dispatched from the Fenrir Far East Branch,
to play the role of shepherds guiding all the Aragami to the location.

00:02:59.210 --> 00:03:03.660
Hey, boy. This is your first mission, right?
You should relax a bit.

00:03:03.670 --> 00:03:05.960
I'm not a boy.
The name's	 Soma.

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:09.280
Oh, I beg your pardon.
You're pratically an adult.

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:09.350
Stop teasing him, Lindow.
Oh, I beg your pardon.
You're pratically an adult.

00:03:09.350 --> 00:03:11.280
Stop teasing him, Lindow.

00:03:26.360 --> 00:03:27.590
They're here.

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:46.090
What's the situation?

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:49.270
An Aragami colony is attacking
the area around the nuclear reactor.

00:03:49.510 --> 00:03:52.290
They have already penetrated the primary armor.

00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:54.180
They are currently being
fought at the secondary defense line.

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:56.950
Guess there was no need to guide them after all.

00:03:57.030 --> 00:03:58.610
Status on the reactor?

00:03:58.620 --> 00:04:02.890
Sir. We've given it a boost,
but it's still at roughly 40%.

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:05.540
It will take some time until it can be detonated,

00:04:05.740 --> 00:04:07.940
but the divine weapon users
have been dispatched against them

00:04:07.940 --> 00:04:09.820
so I think we should hold out.

00:04:11.240 --> 00:04:14.220
We'll have to make them last out until then.

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:17.600
Yes, sir. If necessary they could also...

00:04:21.350 --> 00:04:22.850
Please, get back!

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:29.800
Damn monster!

00:04:39.140 --> 00:04:40.520
They are swarming all over down there!

00:04:40.520 --> 00:04:43.490
We have to buy time until the nuclear reactor is ready.

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:44.550
Are you prepared?

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:47.030
They are pretty violent for sheep.

00:04:47.130 --> 00:04:49.140
Let's go!
Don't let a single one through!

00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:50.760
What are they...

00:05:52.170 --> 00:05:53.700
Are they really human?

00:05:58.440 --> 00:05:59.140
Get back!

00:06:26.890 --> 00:06:28.820
To all soldiers...

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:32.090
All hands... Evacuate...

00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:36.890
I repeat...
All hands... Evacuate!

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:56.080
Hey!
Why are they pulling out?

00:06:56.300 --> 00:06:58.840
Do they mean to abandon us?!

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:01.000
There are more coming.

00:07:08.520 --> 00:07:09.800
Damn it!

00:07:09.800 --> 00:07:11.800
We can't hold out like this!

00:07:25.060 --> 00:07:27.190
You damn monsters!

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:14.420
If that incident was humanity's last foolish act,

00:09:16.330 --> 00:09:18.540
had it shocked the wild gods into silence?

00:09:23.020 --> 00:09:26.970
In any case, the tale is far from over.

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:33.330
As long as we humans keep repeating it...

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:39.960
our atonement to the gods will continue.

00:10:08.680 --> 00:10:09.540
Soma, Soma.

00:10:12.140 --> 00:10:13.100
Hey, Soma!

00:10:16.520 --> 00:10:17.540
It's almost time.

00:10:24.400 --> 00:10:27.090
Even after all this,
are you still coming with us?

00:10:28.280 --> 00:10:30.490
In this messed up world?
